  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.2: Internal metadata patch. Pack-time VerifyServerJsonVersion MSBuild target catches drift between csproj <Version> and the two version fields in .mcp/server.json before producing a stale nupkg. publish-mcp-registry.yml GitHub Actions workflow (manual workflow_dispatch) drives the MCP Server Registry update via GitHub OIDC. No env var metadata is declared — Filesystem reads its allowed directories from CLI positional args per ADR-001 §Resolution chain. No runtime behaviour changes.",
